#: scenario3:scenario3_A2E216FA_4C95_43F9_B3F6_A9DC168A11F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9076615b083ebdde22b9439f7c11c64f1d0f431a1a5156be49685732d5b26653
#. default-sha256: a040dc9fab4afa4ccb2c320d8b1aab4c692e40e675fcc3b128ca8ffce67d6ab5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A2E216FA_4C95_43F9_B3F6_A9DC168A11F0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Approximately a week had passed since then."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫それから、⟪k:3⟫一週間ほどが経った頃のことです。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_CAFDA7DB_FB10_4C06_B482_922B43D1B95E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2c7b5babdf3cb4d449ccefc75563838f41959ada5f4f1a3556dd1b5bb3ae41f4
#. default-sha256: 3c765c8848c452f7164cf11b7756c9916c56014e9956f50a7f2690e9a65691b8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CAFDA7DB_FB10_4C06_B482_922B43D1B95E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl was, as usual, spending her time in her room reading, staying inside "
"the house. ⟪k:1⟫Then, Maria barged in."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫いつものように外にも出ず、⟪k:1⟫自室で本を読みながら時を過ごしている彼女の元に、⟪k:2⟫慌ただし"
"くマリーアが飛び込んできたのです。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4FA7383C_DECE_4819_A7A8_B98BAFCD2BA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a448312262ba5ddc8544c016cad943cdd470b40e0f1dc33ca0da76d6fbba5d9
#. default-sha256: 9621584385d5fbf8c3e4841fc4cc16a0fd145cc6c2f40d148b990a8853a709b3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4FA7383C_DECE_4819_A7A8_B98BAFCD2BA8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Madam! ⟪k:4⟫Madam!⟪k:5⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫奥さま――、⟪k:4⟫奥さまっ！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C05CAF9C_E7FB_4252_8F73_93B193AC5AA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a9afc861f412eb2105ccfa0f5ec9e4bb558f703c65498c0f2fce34b315e99103
#. default-sha256: e0bb202bcafeb77b98b6e9aae1ab0bbac36c80746adf08e86e4118fd08ca7451
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C05CAF9C_E7FB_4252_8F73_93B193AC5AA3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Oh my. You’re out of breath. What happened?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫まあ……、⟪k:8⟫どうしたのですか？⟪k:9⟫　そんなに息を切らし"
"て。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C8DD4FDD_FA29_4704_BD2E_EE0F0369819F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb683d4204c52a673b341278fe7b1388ccd135ca0e703c64672e5d9bef6fe2ff
#. default-sha256: b97aed99791590093fed38e3acc0263275894095cb3872d140ea04d9302b258d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C8DD4FDD_FA29_4704_BD2E_EE0F0369819F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“What happened” is we have a ⟪k:2⟫big problem⟪k:3⟫!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Th-⟪k:6⟫The garden... ⟪k:7⟫"
"The rose garden!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫どうしたもこうしたもないよ！　⟪k:2⟫大変なんだって！　⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ば、⟪k:5⟫薔薇園が……、"
"⟪k:6⟫薔薇園が！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3DCD861F_058E_40BE_AE8A_3310153AA948
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb36d628e91385a3109fd27ed08c13b81e5cc4b7cbfcc570fb051d8878bf05e0
#. default-sha256: 536b40b0877736dd45aa347569b7e2845aa428594cf539f7ed9ae28e8ac585ed
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3DCD861F_058E_40BE_AE8A_3310153AA948"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The garden...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫薔薇園が……？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A65CC86E_007C_44B2_81AA_69D1D601CC5B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 63f54f76969682ddb547f9d2a230838da6cb4f0105c3a48aac1b8f7409fad0ca
#. default-sha256: 2827985c2cdb2cee63b5e153822e998aef701ea7dac3ebb6220ef68b278e296c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A65CC86E_007C_44B2_81AA_69D1D601CC5B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫All the roses you put so much love and care into growing are being chopped down! We’ll "
"lose them all if we don’t hurry!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫奥さまが大切にしていた薔薇がっ、⟪k:2⟫刈り取られていくんだよ！　⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫このままじゃ、"
"⟪k:5⟫全部なくなっちゃうよ……！！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C451D8F3_79C5_477C_BD07_33A30387DFC9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 476db80aa2a5a9898fac8cbd80eccb9402cf58050bb2cc4f9a0321a00b6afdc1
#. default-sha256: fcf555626c147feb07e34b03c44ec872336bc61c5a1ae58f13da4c642e355596
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C451D8F3_79C5_477C_BD07_33A30387DFC9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫………！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_53625603_D41C_4F94_BDBB_CA19473AA8F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d3408cf97176fcc3a8c15ba0ce1ab71b481d69dc7bf335f455a5eb446c245141
#. default-sha256: abab972931fe2bf58f85754ebd66af9f1f659476fd391ef29778418695fa21e8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_53625603_D41C_4F94_BDBB_CA19473AA8F1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Upon hearing the news, the White-Haired Girl dashed from her room and toward "
"the garden, with Maria following close behind."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫その報せを聞いて、⟪k:4⟫慌てて彼女は部屋を飛び出し、⟪k:5⟫薔薇園へと急ぎました。"
"⟪k:6⟫その後を、⟪k:7⟫マリーアも追いかけます。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_48F55368_9472_4E29_9F2C_EF5E121ADF2F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0c5da90fa16479f3404883e9f07a3ecf06a7af50cf09355f5385689280a674b8
#. default-sha256: 4ee178bd7240b207787ad976b1fbe8b3fd314efd8123adfb3aab44b9391d272d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_48F55368_9472_4E29_9F2C_EF5E121ADF2F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫When she arrived, she saw a dozen or so sweaty, rugged men at work, Jacopo "
"shouting orders."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫辿り着いた薔薇園には、⟪k:3⟫大勢の男たちと、⟪k:4⟫それを指揮するヤコポの姿がありまし"
"た。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9FA0374A_0D3A_4740_847F_DA872E153643
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b8e98545424dfeb0f4a85bb9b679757a1369cba3ce5d8b78b671d53da0cd5870
#. default-sha256: 2365ad26489a38c5a73fdcc92a211c1c51a4f6d0a85aead2c03a49ef247aee70
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9FA0374A_0D3A_4740_847F_DA872E153643"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The men clearly had no concept of how much a single flower was worth, no concern whatsoever "
"for their beauty..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫薔薇の美しさなど解さないような、⟪k:1⟫汗まみれの武骨な労働者たち。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫彼らは、⟪k:4⟫薔薇"
"一輪の価値がどれほど高いのかも分からず――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_12875B8E_D8B4_47A3_80A2_186F2DD16547
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0eab6ae8a4ce34b2a80a67d13df70d34d670092be6a86523ab8164a404793b50
#. default-sha256: aca64de6594d3cee954ab4ce3df9b93a59430a949c466551bcf96ef4f7444a3b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_12875B8E_D8B4_47A3_80A2_186F2DD16547"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫for they mercilessly, thoughtlessly hacked away at the shrubs like they were naught but "
"weeds."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ただ乱雑に、⟪k:1⟫無慈悲に、⟪k:2⟫雑草を扱うかのように、⟪k:3⟫刈り取っていくのですわ。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_E6CFDC0C_D817_4D18_99EA_0B6A2BF3C150
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 29143c7f1bfde9c9e50282ec9f23c03d32b1fcd75cb9b3ac2bf2aedbe522d633
#. default-sha256: 5fec7b2c22a904946503b4bacee571a98846f8f9e773fef4feb2f368f3c61dbf
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E6CFDC0C_D817_4D18_99EA_0B6A2BF3C150"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Each flower they tore from the earth extinguished another of the many lives the White-Haired "
"Girl had put so much time and effort into tending for."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫白い髪の娘が、⟪k:1⟫手塩にかけて手入れをした花の命が――奪われていくのです。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9B51C402_245E_46EF_B8EF_ED930F083B75
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5cf513ecfb4f11d1ea5e63aacf8899ce3e3452e2f3d587837074ff888a6da37c
#. default-sha256: a49074d91fcec450bc7add39e5e2140b6b834d55b4de18b5063cf93b9e229142
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9B51C402_245E_46EF_B8EF_ED930F083B75"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫J-⟪k:9⟫Jacopo, what are you—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫ヤ、⟪k:9⟫ヤコポ、⟪k:10⟫あんたなにをやって――。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_12CAB4FA_B234_4881_8F80_676ADCF249FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 90b3aeecb24d64e969af004fc0f768d793b059563159bbfddeb7f055bd24c25e
#. default-sha256: 3aacf190dafa7ddb337af2ca9412d84548002723215692e73139135183e9315e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_12CAB4FA_B234_4881_8F80_676ADCF249FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, hello, Maria.⟪k:2⟫I didn’t expect you would come with her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫なんだ、⟪k:2⟫マリーアか。⟪k:3⟫君まで来るとは意外だな。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_321047B4_09F0_4FA6_9559_0C9EE017413B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b4be375687700dd1478b1af5ec1a2d6e4298969be1b4e7ec9bf92ab19634c67
#. default-sha256: 4432631045ccb091509555ab5fb8b32ab8b8b73847283d545ee7c92d81dc1d3e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_321047B4_09F0_4FA6_9559_0C9EE017413B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Why... ⟪k:2⟫would you do..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫どうして……薔薇園を……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_15CF168C_7991_4E09_AAD1_452A22D77F03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 18b9744ca0b568ff39cd2e79adf2f6236dae4e50c125b58ebcdbf54fcdeb630d
#. default-sha256: 12da13a379cc9163138ca65a81352f8b10f461dd62c7ac12ab2b7802bed188f4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_15CF168C_7991_4E09_AAD1_452A22D77F03"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Why? Why, it goes without saying.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫This house has no need of a garden."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫どうして？　⟪k:2⟫そんなこと、⟪k:3⟫決まっているだろう。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫――不必要だからだ。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_542FEA29_0476_4C94_9B2E_17895E87ADA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a8ed323b304328ef5dfa944db8b6d2038571e481416c07666027eb24475aff4
#. default-sha256: 2098dae70ee5c52fb47c0024842e36b4bd39c07d0a72e201e2c2c69c1163a3bc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_542FEA29_0476_4C94_9B2E_17895E87ADA3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Damn flowers have no place here.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Might as well do something worthwhile with "
"the soil."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫花なんぞこの屋敷に必要ない。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫それくらいならば、⟪k:4⟫土地を有効活用した方が良か"
"ろうよ。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_2BBABD5D_EC2D_4C5B_8F85_9C624B9FD8BB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 66021c2e6a411ac9597eed49098aa93be27674e28eb86a2e817e1ec03fa483f9
#. default-sha256: afa40cc7f661295d5bc2ec43e0591156beb52384d2e454241b907a36c901bfc1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2BBABD5D_EC2D_4C5B_8F85_9C624B9FD8BB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A miniature railroad would be a better use of the space,⟪k:2⟫and certainly a great deal "
"easier on the eyes.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I could even get my hands on some genuine wheels."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫いっそ、⟪k:2⟫鉄道の模型でも置いてやった方が、⟪k:3⟫爽快かもしれんなあ。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫車輪なら"
"現物が手に入るかもしれんぞ。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B207666D_936B_44C9_9C7C_CE9F92B6EFF5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e4f8c68a945bde7199eb5a47974cc2ca3af49044254ec2e6ec8df763f181c784
#. default-sha256: 0951bd577d069be8058083a023a6418c58cf2d6c346a38bdc20aaf0d07ed6d6d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B207666D_936B_44C9_9C7C_CE9F92B6EFF5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The same wheels being used on the revolutionary transcontinental railroad. ⟪k:1⟫Ten or "
"twenty years down the line, they’ll be worth a fortune."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫記念すべき大陸横断鉄道の列車と、⟪k:1⟫同じ型だ。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫数十年後に価値がつくな。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_AFAEDCEF_79E1_4394_AD30_CF7351C71165
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 917c382ab0f52633977f8cf924d106f5e77eb7883302307f66c0d7d381983206
#. default-sha256: b2b8fcff429aed1e1393a94ab5cac752b6f7e2004507de397653e2bfaaed3e3a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AFAEDCEF_79E1_4394_AD30_CF7351C71165"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Jacopo..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……ヤコポ……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_DAE31A6D_DB82_4758_862E_40C74C135399
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 90ee9f44da982e3a0d6c49fd80e0775a120ee29ed0015fb6d235178f263e73c5
#. default-sha256: 6007d90a87ed4ad2a5d082b6973004909c0616631c7b15aecabeb9e673a0c0b3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DAE31A6D_DB82_4758_862E_40C74C135399"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You know... ⟪k:2⟫how much this garden meant to me, don’t you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……私が……、⟪k:2⟫この庭を、⟪k:3⟫大事にしていたことは、⟪k:4⟫ご存じですよね。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_2646F604_F527_40E7_8C94_706205D6CCD2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87cb51371a97b9f8765587b84d9fbea5c1f126b62eac66ace882154976fe5a47
#. default-sha256: d570a87ac64e27792617c330700d19bc580c3aa6d1be9206c4e9ce93bf46452a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2646F604_F527_40E7_8C94_706205D6CCD2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_38620622_641D_4020_97D5_437267C3BE03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db831a6902e8134ff5cdb73468b7f76c8419cb7e7765ab924e36c777f2218e88
#. default-sha256: c7404aef13704cf6f8b2fe66a795878f5c1f91118b2b56a7f3a7a05b2df626a8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_38620622_641D_4020_97D5_437267C3BE03"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Did it honestly have no place here?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Flowers have a calming effect on people. "
"They give you peace."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫不必要なものだったのでしょうか……。⟪k:2⟫花は人々の心を落ち着かせます。⟪k:3⟫安らぎを与えて"
"くれるものなんです。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_ECB13A2E_A293_4572_871D_76EC1EEE57E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 42cbd95cc63871509044a151cf8902eae0c3c679ae3b3c2f54bfd2a0801e621e
#. default-sha256: 9a3e36e4d47d2a5a09d6127342df2e898f157d9bd922dbf1bae15a40182fa200
