msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But in any case, Jacopo had caused many people great pain in order to repurpose that garden "
"for himself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫とにかくも――、⟪k:1⟫ヤコポは多くの人の気持ちを踏みにじり、⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫自分のためだけに庭を変えて"
"しまったのですわ。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_FEA60DD2_A735_4799_AA1D_26C227345BD0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d7c8301eb6d8783aae37dfc2d1673b4059229656e07a4ed1d878ec08cfbc2513
#. default-sha256: 71c5649432ecbaebafc670d10e66a08d6a145c5b74932e9f4f79765163622d08
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FEA60DD2_A735_4799_AA1D_26C227345BD0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And he continued to walk all over his wife. ⟪k:1⟫Whenever she tried to do something kind for "
"him, he would brush her off, saying, “That’s not your place.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それ以降も、⟪k:1⟫ヤコポは妻をないがしろにし続けました。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫彼女が善意で何かしようとして"
"も「余計な真似だ」と突っぱね――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C55223D9_5795_4B6C_98B6_7358EFEEEE4F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 74d6d1d3999184291707a56454ec0b128de4820095610ffbe966cdadfccf92b4
#. default-sha256: 7254f56f78cc2123cbd41e708447b7ad10966bf2da6b82a86c371b80f21d07f1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C55223D9_5795_4B6C_98B6_7358EFEEEE4F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He paid no mind whatsoever to the looks of dejection that rose to her face each time he "
"rejected her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼女が寂しげな表情を浮かべたとしても、⟪k:1⟫見向きもいたしません。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F89FDF2E_9C37_4FC5_B341_FD9968647660
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b5114cd3ebaaab5fe37172a05fef5e4b54c9159a8df05ffe37f17ec9bb5df0c
