msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F89FDF2E_9C37_4FC5_B341_FD9968647660"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was beginning to wonder if anything she had said about the man he had been a year earlier "
"was actually true."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……彼女が語った一年前の話は、⟪k:1⟫本当だったのか。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫疑ってしまうほどでございました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B59BE9EC_BFBD_4C8E_A079_A1A51F6A3C91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a2ee3786385ebb102408bc857362087afe9792e2ccb8ffa0bd953868673bb217
